  {
   "texto": "The power died at 9:40 at night. I have been in this elevator for six hours.",
   "pausa": 0.9,
   "vel": 0.88
  },
  {
   "texto": "At first I yelled for help. Then I started saving my voice.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "A little after midnight, something knocked. Three times. Slow.",
   "pausa": 1.0,
   "vel": 0.85
  },
  {
   "texto": "I said hello. The knocking stopped immediately.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then a woman started crying on the other side of the door.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "She said she was hurt. She said the stairwell was full of them.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "She begged me to open the door. Please. Just a little.",
   "pausa": 0.9,
   "vel": 0.84
  },
  {
   "texto": "And my hand was already on the latch.",
   "pausa": 1.0,
   "vel": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3,
   "vel": 0.88
